Runtime Dependencies
================================================================================

Inquery also depends on many open-source libraries at build and runtime (for
example Spring Boot, LangChain4j, SvelteKit, Tauri, PostgreSQL/pgvector, and
database JDBC drivers downloaded separately by users). Those components are
distributed under their own licenses and are not listed exhaustively here.
Refer to each dependency's published license (Maven `pom.xml`, npm
`package-lock.json`, and vendor JDBC documentation) for details.

JDBC drivers are not bundled with this repository. Users must download and
install drivers for their target databases separately; each driver is subject
to its vendor's license terms.
